# Player 57, stretch 1 (poolrad.md's stretch table): New Phlan: shop, City Hall's clerk, inn, memorize.
# From p2start/p57_party_a (3:0 0,4 W 00:00, after Rolf's tour). Party A: VOSS F, GRUM F/T, MAREN C, OSRIC C,
# SYLVAR F/MU, TAVIN MU; 600 gold in all. Shop prices read in the original (p57s0): Long Sword 15, Mace 8, Short Bow 15,
# 10 Arrows 1, 4 Darts 1, Scale 45, Chain 75, Banded 90, Shield 15.
# The loadout: the line in the best armour the purse allows (VOSS, MAREN, OSRIC banded; GRUM chain, his thief skills
# wait while he wears it; SYLVAR scale), two bows (VOSS, SYLVAR: READY in a fight is free), TAVIN 20 darts.
