rules ../../plans/playthrough.plan
buy 0 Long Sword | 0 Banded Mail | 0 Shield | 0 Short Bow | 0 10 Arrows | 0 10 Arrows | 1 Long Sword | 1 Chain Mail | 1 Shield | 2 Mace | 2 Banded Mail | 2 Shield | 3 Mace | 3 Banded Mail | 3 Shield | 4 Long Sword | 4 Scale Mail | 4 Shield | 4 Short Bow | 4 10 Arrows | 4 10 Arrows | 5 Quarter Staff | 5 4 Darts | 5 4 Darts | 5 4 Darts | 5 4 Darts | 5 4 Darts
